r":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"最終的にJavaScriptに落ちる言語なので型情報を使うことができないんですよねぇ…","ts":"1627023049.237500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1vL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1c5d770-b1f7-4ab8-a5b0-54c68609e3ec","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"`invokeOrReturn\u0026lt;S\u0026gt;` \u0026lt;- この `S` が function なら、みたいな表現","ts":"1627023028.237100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sJl8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cf25f2d-f8b1-4143-a639-26838717c876","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"これ型パラメータにに入っている型よる条件分岐ってできないんですかね?","ts":"1627022988.236300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZBm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c46e4a8-315f-45da-8e5b-a8f77486f5c6","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まぁでも JavaScript の柔軟な表現力のまま型におとそうとしてるので、そのまま使おうとするとある程度は仕方ない...","ts":"1627022771.235300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3jC9/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c85492a1-8013-4697-b03d-1ebfbbacd826","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ですねー...","ts":"1627022733.234500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WfaaC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5e2ce34-a5e4-4c9f-b8cb-18fdff2ac474","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どうやってもhackyな見た目にしかならないのでつらそう","ts":"1627022722.234300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r+b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6305e7fb-ee36-47ec-8243-cf2de5a83f27","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"argがfunctionならfをそのまま返してしまう","ts":"1627022712.233900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Teu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2908da6-222e-48c9-a81d-9749ac2b8fd1","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あーそっかなるほど、そっちをチェックすればいいんですね","ts":"1627022694.233600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"89F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a797546-bb43-4871-9253-28e7d8f2f4b9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それをどうしてもやりたいならargがfunctionかも調べる必要がありそうだけどやりすぎ感が否めないな","ts":"1627022659.232900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vOp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da1c9eb1-98a6-4275-a166-f698434517a7","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まぁでもこれは元から(中身は JavaScript のコードそのままなので)そういう挙動なはず...","ts":"1627022652.232800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6bV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d1148a4-36a5-4016-bdea-76d8421408a5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```const one = () =\u0026gt; 1;\nconst f = () =\u0026gt; 10;\ninvokeOrReturn\u0026lt;() =\u0026gt; number\u0026gt;(one, f); // =\u0026gt; 10 (期待するのは () =\u0026gt; 10)```\nぐぬぅ、それはそう...","ts":"1627022383.230500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"58KgO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"883d41c5-9d9e-43b2-bcf2-6cc197ae36a7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"多分そう(自分もよく分かってないです)","ts":"1627021780.228700","thread_ts":"1627021221.226000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ATakn"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"57f0fbee-1359-4f1a-8ef3-6be87c33d66f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まだちょっと理解しきれてないので\n`invokeOrReturn(\"hoge\", (hoge: string) =\u0026gt; 3);` が弾かれるのは、`(hoge: string) =\u0026gt; 3` が `(arg: string) =\u0026gt; string` にマッチしないから、であってますか?","ts":"1627021221.226000","thread_ts":"1627021221.226000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"shF4"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"b40e96cf-7940-48e7-a280-3b0f4e31c847","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"この推論は効かないのか...","ts":"1627021493.228600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZDnGZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4d807cb-7dc1-469c-ad8f-73c134d41288","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、ちゃんと `S` を明記すれば通った \u0026gt; 型チェック","ts":"1627021410.228300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9kv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be98eebc-d19d-42a5-98f1-56479e1eabc3","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```const id = (arg: number) =\u0026gt; arg;\ninvokeOrReturn(id, id)```\nこれ型チェック通ると思ったら通らなかった...なんでだろ","ts":"1627021269.226900","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1627021369.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uXew0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57f0fbee-1359-4f1a-8ef3-6be87c33d66f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まだちょっと理解しきれてないので\n`invokeOrReturn(\"hoge\", (hoge: string) =\u0026gt; 3);` が弾かれるのは、`(hoge: string) =\u0026gt; 3` が `(arg: string) =\u0026gt; string` にマッチしないから、であってますか?","ts":"1627021221.226000","thread_ts":"1627021221.226000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"shF4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b55db56-d9c2-4735-ae5f-916dcdfeae05","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"まあ、DTのReactのuseStateの定義がこれなので行けないはずないと思ったんですよね\n`function useState\u0026lt;S\u0026gt;(initialState: S | (() =\u0026gt; S)): [S, Dispatch\u0026lt;SetStateAction\u0026lt;S\u0026gt;\u0026gt;];`","ts":"1627020617.223200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BjM1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a66bfca-bed4-4600-9ff6-15bf865c3809","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"関数部分を `(hoge: number) =\u0026gt; \"hoge\"`にしても拒否されるのでこれでよさそう？","ts":"1627020470.222500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x1z7b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"602a68a6-1714-409c-96d1-07a9a7695cce","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ですです、拒否してくれたのはちょっと驚きました、Sの方で通っちゃうかと思ったので","ts":"1627020421.221700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SgTB0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f2bb8e6-244d-4e5b-ad00-1d6274770e29","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あー `S \u0026amp; Function` で引数を取れない型は入れないという前提に立って `as any` で通すってことですかね?","ts":"1627020305.220900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"19c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ec10d72-a114-4e16-a7c7-b6ab6c6ab88d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"上のコードは型チェッカーに拒否される","ts":"1627020115.218900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UQP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ab8a125-1435-4c5e-826f-59981316653c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なんか弾かれてる雰囲気あるので案外これでもいいのかも\n```function invokeOrReturn\u0026lt;S\u0026gt;(arg: S, f: S | ((arg: S) =\u0026gt; S)): S {\n  return typeof f === 'function' ? (f as any)(arg) : f;\n}\n\ninvokeOrReturn(\"hoge\", (hoge: string) =\u0026gt; 3);```","ts":"1627020064.218400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Moy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"808a6fd5-2610-4c64-9f4e-32d4de2c6ab2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なるほどreducerと組み合わせて使う前提なんか","ts":"1627019750.217700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KxNW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52128db9-4d48-4427-89fb-046699503160","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ちなみにこれが正しいかという自信は全くないので違ったらすみません(コンパイラくんは正しいと言ってきてるけど)","ts":"1627019652.217200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DyuS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31b1cc13-d406-47a1-81c7-dab49c452942","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"なるほど","ts":"1627019627.216600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/M9W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68880a6c-7712-4a01-889c-5eaefd08f4c4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"numberも使いたかったら `number | Object` とかする必要があってだるい\nstring等も同様","ts":"1627019615.216400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m4="}]},{"client_msg_id":"78626e0e-20ea-4ffe-a8a9-67f5a88943d4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Objectでなければならない、のでObjectではないfunctionは弾かれるという算段ですね","ts":"1627019591.215900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D3/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a11eb2a2-42b8-4578-a67b-a939930be244","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、それを union で繋げばいいんですかね?","ts":"1627019584.215600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vz91"}]},{"client_msg_id":"213e5801-e277-47af-b667-4f10310dc656","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"`\u0026lt;S extends Object\u0026gt;` だと `S` は `function` であってはならない、ですかね?","ts":"1627019570.215200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"leU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a98d0681-976c-4f07-aeac-ea4251be0025","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"`invokeOrReturn` のシグネチャ自体は \u003chttps://github.com/preactjs/preact/blob/master/hooks/src/index.js\u003e これに型を付けたらどうなるか考えてるだけなので、一旦は","ts":"1627019488.214100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQED"}]},{"client_msg_id":"597cd7e8-901f-4b9e-9dbf-39ac23ea6110","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"後KoRoNさんが言われてる通りこの定義だとargが捨てられるのが気になりますね","ts":"1627019443.213400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EB+G1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08c68ab8-416c-43a3-a1aa-e85df21b64ab","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Sのままだと関数である可能性が含まれるので制約で弾く\n本当にやるならプリミティブ型分だけunionで繋ぐ必要があってだるいけど","ts":"1627019352.212200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0XA3P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed2c71fe-c420-483e-a1c8-57943ad16d29","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ものすごく雑だけどこうするしかないのでは\n```function invokeOrReturn\u0026lt;S extends Object\u0026gt;(arg: S, f: S | ((arg: S) =\u0026gt; S)): S {\n  return typeof f === 'function' ? f(arg) : f;\n}\n\ninvokeOrReturn({}, {});```","ts":"1627019315.211100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"la1n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faf7f113-2f99-45a0-82a8-c7f3b60a1099","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そんときarg書くのって気持ち悪くない? 使う方としては。","ts":"1627019271.210400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ojpp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e2c1694-2140-4460-814c-4c04488359c2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"fがSのときargは捨てられちゃうでしょ?","ts":"1627019253.209900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"neJw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00e4d386-a83c-4e3b-a7e4-60e2cbeb03f1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとわかんないのは","ts":"1627019242.209600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ww/H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1981078c-1da6-4d56-9775-593d8ddb563b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あと書けると嬉しいのが `typeof arg === typeof f` なんですよね\n// 実際はこう書くと大体全部 `'object' === 'object'` になってだめなんですけど...","ts":"1627018961.208400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3gp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e30ca8c2-8dab-4c70-b4ce-effaf4772274","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"型によるパターンマッチ、があれば(あるのかどうか\u0026amp;どの程度の強さなのかすら知らないけど)理論的にはできるとおもうけど。","ts":"1627018880.207000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jK2F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"604607f6-df8d-4d9b-81dd-1f57751d879b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"つまりTypeScriptレベルでやるしかないけどそれも無さそうな気がしてる","ts":"1627018870.206700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vpy2N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cece59a-9082-4523-a20d-8ec3a7662e3d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"型の無い言語で返り値が常に正しいかをチェックする方法は無かったと思う","ts":"1627018845.205900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F3RYj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67ff02a4-fa82-49a4-9ef6-b48c0375ad1a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"期待する挙動は `S` が `(arg: S) =\u0026gt; S` 以外の関数の場合はそのまま返してほしい","ts":"1627018834.205500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhyKf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e84db43-962c-4350-8f31-6b89c8464f76","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"実行時アサーションでチェックする方法はないのでは","ts":"1627018809.204700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BVZjy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7b73ee4-0682-410d-9536-50484c320b77","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あーそうですね、 `typeof f === 'function'` だとそれもチェックできてなさそうか...","ts":"1627018788.204100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gHrA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec9ac278-6dad-4cc1-8c50-3218cfa5ac16","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"エラーはこれ\n```This expression is not callable. Not all constituents of type '((arg: S) =\u0026gt; S) | (S \u0026amp; Function)' are callable. Type 'S \u0026amp; Function' has no call signatures.```","ts":"1627018756.203200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97289fee-d67e-40dc-805e-e18d25544352","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとは `S` が `(arg:S) =\u0026gt; S` 以外の関数だったらどうなるんやろ?","ts":"1627018733.202800","thread_ts":"1627018733.202800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1627018740.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sr4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"332b2955-3216-4730-8cd3-5447f07422a7","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、すません、そこはそうですね\n`function invokeOrReturn\u0026lt;S\u0026gt;(arg: S, f: S | ((arg: S) =\u0026gt; S)): S` でした","ts":"1627018659.201400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oPlUt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"666b6610-51cb-4475-b7a1-80008b4a7dba","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"良く分かってないけど当然では? `() =\u0026gt; S` って指定したらその関数は引数取 ~ら~ れないのでは?","ts":"1627018452.199600","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1627018478.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hGlE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fa1926e-475f-42ca-ab6a-e2139a2e1314","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"```function invokeOrReturn\u0026lt;S\u0026gt;(arg: S, f: S | (() =\u0026gt; S)): S {\n  return typeof f === 'function' ? f(arg) : f;\n}```\n`f` が `S` 型ならそのまま返して、`f` が関数っぽかったら `arg` を適用して返す\nみたいな関数にいい感じに型を付けたいんですが、なんかよい方法はあるでしょうか...\nこのコードだと、`f` が `S \u0026amp; Function` 型の場合に引数取れないぞって怒られるのです...\nXOR 型的なのが欲しいまたは引数を取る関数型っていう型ガードを表現したい...","ts":"1627017917.198500","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1627018012.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9uP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24ed11be-34b2-452c-85da-6612ea920118","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そこまで厳密なことはコンパイラがサポートしてないから考えなくても良い、ってことなのかしら?","ts":"1627018764.203400","thread_ts":"1627018733.202800","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V3F"}]}]
